aims-os-math-extras (2.1+1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Drop geogebra. Trixie packages GeoGebra 4.0.34, a 2011 release
    that no longer matches what the geometry courses use. The current
    GeoGebra Classic is install-on-demand via Flatpak
    (org.geogebra.GeoGebra on Flathub); Flatpak + the Flathub remote
    already ship in aims-os-desktop.

 -- AIMS Senegal IT <hakim@aims-senegal.org>  Wed, 29 Jul 2026 15:10:00 +0000

aims-os-math-extras (2.1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Carved out of aims-os-math. Holds the full v2.0
    scientific stack: Maxima, full Octave, R tidyverse, multilingual
    TeX Live (English, other, Arabic, publishers, science, XeTeX,
    LuaTeX, bibtex-extra), TeXstudio, GeoGebra, niche Python (mpi4py,
    biopython, skimage, igraph, rpy2, tables, pygments, reportlab),
    and the HDF5 / GMP / MPFR development headers.

 -- AIMS Senegal IT <hakim@aims-senegal.org>  Wed, 27 May 2026 03:00:00 +0000
